000010* String, character and miscellaneous intrinsic functions,
000020* compared with stock GnuCOBOL 3.2: UPPER/LOWER-CASE, REVERSE,
000030* CONCATENATE, SUBSTITUTE(-CASE), TRIM, LENGTH family, CHAR, ORD,
000040* ORD-MIN/MAX, NUMVAL family + TEST-NUMVAL family, BIT/HEX,
000050* CONTENT-*, MODULE-*, WHEN-COMPILED, EXCEPTION-*, CURRENCY-SYMBOL
000060* Values that vary per run (dates, paths) are tested by length.
000070 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000080 PROGRAM-ID. FUNCSTR.
000090 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
000100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
000110 FILE-CONTROL.
000120     SELECT NOFILE ASSIGN TO "FUNCSTR-NO-SUCH.DAT"
000130         ORGANIZATION LINE SEQUENTIAL
000140         FILE STATUS IS FS.
000150 DATA DIVISION.
000160 FILE SECTION.
000170 FD NOFILE.
000180 01 NOREC          PIC X(10).
000190 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000200 01 FS             PIC XX.
000210 01 TXT            PIC X(20) VALUE "  Hello, World 42  ".
000220 01 SPC            PIC X(6)  VALUE SPACES.
000230 01 MIX            PIC X(12) VALUE "aBc-XyZ 0129".
000240 01 NUMD           PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE -123.45.
000250 01 UNUM           PIC 9(4) VALUE 77.
000260 01 NV             PIC X(12).
000270 01 CUR            PIC X(3).
000280 01 RX             PIC X(30).
000290 01 RN             PIC S9(9)V9(4).
000300 01 RE             PIC -Z(8)9.9(4).
000310 01 RI             PIC 9(4).
000320 01 PTR            USAGE POINTER.
000330 01 IX             PIC 99.
000340 01 C1             PIC X.
000350 01 HB             PIC X(48).
000360 01 BB             PIC X(160).
000370 01 TST.
000380    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "  123       ".
000390    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "-123.45     ".
000400    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "123.45-     ".
000410    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "  +7.5      ".
000420    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "12.5CR      ".
000430    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "12.5 db     ".
000440    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "1,234.56    ".
000450    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "ABC         ".
000460    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "            ".
000470    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "0.000       ".
000480    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "1.2.3       ".
000490    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE " - 5        ".
000500    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE ".5          ".
000510    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "5.          ".
000520    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "+12-        ".
000530    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "12 3        ".
000540    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "-1,2        ".
000550    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "A1          ".
000560    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "$1,234.56   ".
000570    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "$ 12.00CR   ".
000580    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "-$5         ".
000590    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "12$         ".
000600    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "$$1         ".
000610    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "0000012.50  ".
000620    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "-0          ".
000630    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "1234567890.1".
000640 01 TSTR REDEFINES TST.
000650    05 TV          PIC X(12) OCCURS 26.
000660 01 TSF.
000670    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "1.5E+3      ".
000680    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "-2.5E-2     ".
000690    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "12          ".
000700    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE " +3.0E+00   ".
