000730    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "0.25E+2     ".
000740    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "7E+30       ".
000750    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "abc         ".
000760    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "  -2.5      ".
000770    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "1.5E+3X     ".
000780    05 FILLER      PIC X(12) VALUE "            ".
000790 01 TSFR REDEFINES TSF.
000800    05 FV          PIC X(12) OCCURS 12.
000810 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000820 MAIN-PARA.
000830     DISPLAY "CURRENCY [" FUNCTION CURRENCY-SYMBOL "]"
